===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|ja|karakasa}}
{{ja-kanjitab|からかさ|yomi=kun|alt=唐傘}}
[[File:Umbrella-C7068.jpg|thumb|250px|{{m|ja|傘|id=karakasa|tr=karakasa}}: a '''traditional Japanese folding umbrella'''.]]

Compound of {{compound|ja|唐|tr1=kara|t1=Chinese; foreign|傘|id2=kasa|tr2=kasa|t2=raingear}}.  First attested in the ''{{w|Utsubo Monogatari}}'' of the late 900s.<ref name="NKDc">{{R:ja:NKD Concise}}</ref>

